The sideways reach of each handle is the **influence**, and it sets how long the ease lasts. Easy Ease gives every key the same reach, so every move feels the same.

Make each move start quickly and land softly:
- Drag the handle on the landing key sideways along the bottom to make it longer.
- Make the handle on the start key shorter.

